OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do sausage rolls and
OL,4,Aveterinary fees vary in price across
OL,5,ALondon?
OL,6,
OL,7,FHave you ever wondered why the same
OL,8,Fitem costs more or less depending on
OL,9,Fwhere in London you buy it?
OL,11,FTake a bog standard Greggs' sausage
OL,12,Froll for example. If you buy it in an
OL,13,Fouter London borough like Sutton, it
OL,14,Fcosts #1.35. But if you buy it in
OL,15,Fcentral London you're likely to pay
OL,16,F#1.60.
OL,18,FYou might have guessed that the price
OL,19,Fdifference, according to Greggs, is
OL,20,Foften about location.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
