OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do sausage rolls and
OL,4,Aveterinary fees vary in price across
OL,5,ALondon?
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We use national pricing across most of
OL,8,Four shops however, this can vary in
OL,9,Fcertain locations where costs are
OL,10,Fhigher than average, such as travel
OL,11,Fhubs," they told the BBC in a
OL,12,Fstatement.
